{"seq":1,"slug":"filter-bubble-mitigate","title":"信息茧房缓解与探索位","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-result-diversity-dedup/personalization-balance/filter-bubble-mitigate","wordCount":3263,"readingTime":14,"html":"<h1 id=\"信息茧房缓解与探索位\">信息茧房缓解与探索位</h1><p>个性化排序有一个内在的自我强化过程：模型从用户历史里学到偏好，把偏好相关的商品排到前面，用户只点击这些商品，产生的新行为又把偏好信号加强。几轮之后，列表变成一维的——系统运作完全正常，指标也许还在涨，但用户的视野在被缓慢收窄。这个过程叫信息茧房（filter bubble），它不是模型的 bug，而是<strong>在没有反向力量时，反馈闭环的必然稳态</strong>。本文讲清怎么度量它、以及探索位这类反向力量的工程实现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-茧房是反馈闭环的稳态-不是模型错误\">核心概念：茧房是反馈闭环的稳态，不是模型错误</h2><p>先给出机制的准确形式。设用户对类目 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 的真实兴趣为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，系统在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 的曝光分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_t(c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，用户的点击行为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 和曝光的双重影响决定（用户只能点击被展示的东西，这叫<strong>曝光偏差</strong>）。模型用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(p_t, y_t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 更新对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 的估计 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat\\theta_{t+1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1662em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，而排序用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat\\theta_{t+1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1662em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 生成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{t+1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。闭环是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_t \\to y_t \\to \\hat\\theta_{t+1} \\to p_{t+1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1662em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个闭环的稳态特征是「曝光分布与点击分布互相印证」——系统看不到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 中那些从未被曝光的分量，因此永远不更新它们。工程上这叫<strong>探索不足导致的估计偏差</strong>，它不是统计噪声，而是系统性的盲区：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在未被探索的维度上永远停在先验值上。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[用户真实兴趣 θ] --&gt; B[系统估计 θ̂]&#10;    B --&gt; C[排序生成曝光分布 p]&#10;    C --&gt; D[用户点击 y&lt;br/&gt;只看得到被曝光的]&#10;    D --&gt; E[用 y 更新 θ̂]&#10;    E --&gt; B&#10;    C --&gt; F{是否有反向力量?}&#10;    F --&gt;|无| G[曝光与点击互相印证&lt;br/&gt;茧房稳态]&#10;    F --&gt;|有| H[探索位/配额&lt;br/&gt;打破闭环]&#10;    H --&gt; E\">graph TD\n    A[用户真实兴趣 θ] --&gt; B[系统估计 θ̂]\n    B --&gt; C[排序生成曝光分布 p]\n    C --&gt; D[用户点击 y&lt;br/&gt;只看得到被曝光的]\n    D --&gt; E[用 y 更新 θ̂]\n    E --&gt; B\n    C --&gt; F{是否有反向力量?}\n    F --&gt;|无| G[曝光与点击互相印证&lt;br/&gt;茧房稳态]\n    F --&gt;|有| H[探索位/配额&lt;br/&gt;打破闭环]\n    H --&gt; E</pre><p>打破闭环的力量有三类：<strong>注入</strong>（强制展示未探索的内容，即探索位）、<strong>正则</strong>（在排序目标里加多样性项，如 MMR 类重排）、<strong>随机化</strong>（以一定概率打散或随机化排序）。本文讲第一类与它的度量，第二类属于推荐侧的列表级重排（MMR 的机制见相邻 hub <code>../../19_product-recommendation-engineering/3_ranking-diversity/2_diversity-mmr.md</code>），第三类是 A/B 实验设计的一部分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"茧房的度量-从行为日志里看收窄\">茧房的度量：从行为日志里看收窄</h2><p>茧房是<strong>跨会话</strong>现象，不能靠单次请求的列表度量。工程上能观测的是四个代理指标，它们从不同侧面刻画收窄。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>收窄的表现</th>\n<th>观测窗口</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>类目熵趋势</td>\n<td>用户近 30 天曝光类目分布的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>单调下降</td>\n<td>月度，按用户群</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>曝光集中度</td>\n<td>Top-3 类目占该用户曝光的比例</td>\n<td>上升</td>\n<td>月度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新类目发现率</td>\n<td>首次曝光的类目数 / 该用户总曝光类目数</td>\n<td>下降至 0</td>\n<td>月度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨用户多样性</td>\n<td>用户间曝光分布的 JS 散度中位数</td>\n<td>下降（所有人看到同样的东西）</td>\n<td>月度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第三个「新类目发现率」最容易解释也最灵敏：它直接回答「这个用户最近还看到过新东西吗」。当它降到 0，该用户的列表已经完全被历史偏好锁定。</p>\n<p>这里有一个必须提前声明的<strong>口径陷阱</strong>：这四个指标都会随「用户使用时长增加」自然上升或下降，与茧房无关。一个用了三年的老用户，其类目熵本来就该比新用户低（他已经知道喜欢什么），这是正常的收敛而非茧房。因此<strong>判据必须是同群组的时间序列趋势，而不是跨用户的横截面比较</strong>。正确的读法是：把用户按活跃时长分层，看每层内部的趋势；只有当「同等活跃时长的用户其指标随时间显著下降」时才算茧房迹象。</p>\n<p>判定还需要一个<strong>对照组</strong>：随机抽取一部分用户关掉个性化（或大幅降低个性化强度），作为反事实基线。个性化组的类目熵下降速度显著快于对照组，才是茧房的证据。这个实验设计与普通 A/B 不同，它需要长周期（月度）和持续固定的分流，见 <a href=\"../diversity-ops/diversity-ab-experiment\">多样性 A/B 与效果验证</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"探索位的三种插入方式\">探索位的三种插入方式</h2><p>探索位（exploration slot）是在结果列表里预留若干位置，专门展示<strong>非个性化最优</strong>的内容。它的工程难点不在「插进去」，而在「插什么」和「怎么计量」。</p>\n<p><strong>插什么</strong>取决于探索的目的，三种典型目标对应三种内容选择：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>探索目标</th>\n<th>内容选择</th>\n<th>位置策略</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>打破偏好锁定</td>\n<td>用户历史低覆盖类目的高分商品</td>\n<td>靠后（第 8–20 位）</td>\n<td>低相关，点击率低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收集新偏好信号</td>\n<td>模型不确定度最高的商品（高方差）</td>\n<td>中段，且多样分布</td>\n<td>模型可能过度自信</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>验证长期价值</td>\n<td>新品类、新品、新商家</td>\n<td>均匀分布</td>\n<td>短期指标下滑</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第一类的「低覆盖类目高分商品」是最常用的：从用户历史未曝光（或曝光极少）的类目里，取该用户画像相关性中等偏上的商品。它避开了「完全随机」的低效率，因为即便用户没买过这个类目，商品本身的全局质量在那里。</p>\n<p>第二类依赖模型的不确定度估计。这是<strong>上下文老虎机</strong>的正规形式——选择「不确定性最高」的臂来最大化长期信息收益，其算法（Thompson 采样、UCB）与冷启动的利用-探索权衡见 <a href=\"diversity-exploit-explore\">利用与探索平衡</a>，本文不重复。</p>\n<p>第三类需要最长的验证周期，因为它的收益要在「用户是否形成了新的长期类目偏好」上体现，往往要一个季度才能看见。它通常只在少数流量上跑。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么计量</strong>是探索位最容易被忽视的部分。如果探索位和普通位混在一起做统计，它的低点击率会拉低整页指标，给人「探索位伤害体验」的印象。正确做法是<strong>按位置分层统计</strong>，并且明确探索位是<strong>付出</strong>（用短期点击换长期信息），因此它的验收指标不是 CTR 而是「探索位是否产生了有效的新偏好信号」：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>SignalYield</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>探索位曝光后被后续会话重复点击/购买的类目数</mtext><mtext>探索位曝光总数</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{SignalYield} = \\frac{\\text{探索位曝光后被后续会话重复点击/购买的类目数}}{\\text{探索位曝光总数}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SignalYield</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.113em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">探索位曝光总数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">探索位曝光后被后续会话重复点击</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">购买的类目数</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个量衡量「探索花了钱，买到了多少信息」。它的合理量级因类目而异，服饰类目通常高于 3C（服饰的探索意愿更强），所以不能跨类目横向比较，只能按类目看趋势。</p>\n<h2 id=\"探索率的调节-固定比例-greedy-与自适应\">探索率的调节：固定比例、ε-greedy 与自适应</h2><p>探索位占多少比例，是核心策略参数。三档实现，复杂度递增。</p>\n<p><strong>固定比例</strong>最简单：每 20 条里插 1 条探索位（5%）。它的好处是完全可预测、易于归因、易于向业务解释。缺点是它对所有用户一视同仁——一个已经高度收窄的用户和一个视野开阔的用户拿到同样的探索强度，前者需要更多，后者不需要。</p>\n<p><strong>ε-greedy</strong> 让探索概率与用户状态挂钩：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>ε</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>ε</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>ε</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mtext>Novelty</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon(u) = \\varepsilon_{\\min} + (\\varepsilon_{\\max} - \\varepsilon_{\\min}) \\cdot \\big(1 - \\text{Novelty}(u)\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Novelty</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Novelty</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Novelty}(u)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Novelty</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是用户的新颖度（可用「新类目发现率」或「近期曝光熵」归一化），越收窄的用户 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 越高。这个形式的好处是把「茧房程度」直接映射成探索强度，逻辑自洽、可解释。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 通常不低于 2%，因为即使视野开阔的用户也需要少量探索来跟踪兴趣漂移。</p>\n<p><strong>自适应</strong>（上下文老虎机）把探索率交给算法优化，目标是长期累积收益最大。Thompson 采样的做法是对每个候选保留后验分布，采样后按采样值排序，天然产生「不确定的候选有概率被选中」的探索行为。它的理论保证更强，代价是可解释性差、需要更严谨的离线评估和更长的实验周期。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>可解释性</th>\n<th>冷启动成本</th>\n<th>适用阶段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>固定比例</td>\n<td>1 个（比例）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>首次上线，建立基线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ε-greedy</td>\n<td>3 个（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>ε</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon_{\\min}, \\varepsilon_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，新颖度定义）</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>主流量方案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上下文老虎机</td>\n<td>后验超参</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高（需足够曝光）</td>\n<td>成熟期，有充足流量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>从固定比例起步、观察一段时间后再切 ε-greedy 是稳妥的路径，因为前者的数据是后者调参的输入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"探索位与打散-去重的执行顺序\">探索位与打散、去重的执行顺序</h2><p>探索位不能简单地「插进最终列表」，因为它会与去重和打散互相干扰。正确的顺序是：<strong>去重 → 打散 → 插入探索位 → 再校验约束</strong>。</p>\n<p>先把去重做完，因为探索位展示的商品如果是已展示项的重复，探索就白做了。再把打散做完，因为探索位的商品通常来自低覆盖类目，它们天然有助于类目铺开，先插入会让打散算法「以为」类目已经够分散而减少后续打散——这会让非探索位的部分变得更同质。最后插入探索位，并重新校验打散约束：探索位自身的类目也可能与自己冲突（例如两个探索位是同一类目），需要在小范围内再散一次。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"function assemble(items, explorePool, cfg):&#10;  list = dedup(items)&#10;  list = scatter(list, cfg.window, cfg.quotas)&#10;  for slot in cfg.exploreSlots:&#10;    if not explorePool.isEmpty():&#10;      cand = explorePool.pick(list, cfg.explorePolicy)&#10;      list = insertAt(list, cand, slot)&#10;  return revalidate(list, cfg.softConstraints)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function assemble(items, explorePool, cfg):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  list = dedup(items)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  list = scatter(list, cfg.window, cfg.quotas)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for slot in cfg.exploreSlots:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if not explorePool.isEmpty():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      cand = explorePool.pick(list, cfg.explorePolicy)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      list = insertAt(list, cand, slot)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return revalidate(list, cfg.softConstraints)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>explorePool.pick</code> 里的 <code>list</code> 参数很重要：探索候选的选择要<strong>排除已在列表中的</strong>，否则探索位退化成重复位。这个检查必须基于去重键而不是商品 ID，理由与 <a href=\"../dedup-scatter/pagination-dedup-consistency\">跨分页去重一致性</a> 所述相同。</p>\n<p>另外一个容易漏掉的约束是<strong>探索位不能插入付费广告位和合规必展位</strong>。这些位置有独立的契约（广告位的定价与合规位的法规要求），探索策略不能占用。这类「不可侵入」的位置应该在配置里声明为保护区，其配置方式与业务规则的其它部分一致，见 <a href=\"../diversity-ops/diversity-rule-config\">多样性规则按市场/品类配置</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"长期指标的验证难题\">长期指标的验证难题</h2><p>探索位的收益是长周期的，这让验收变得困难：短期 A/B 只能测到「探索位点击率低」这个坏消息，测不到「用户三个月后留存更好」这个好消息。处理这个难题有三条实践路径。</p>\n<p><strong>第一，用代理指标做短期判据。</strong> 「SignalYield」是首选代理——它在两周内就能观测到，且与长期收益相关。次选是「探索位的后续会话回访率」（用户看到探索商品后，在后续会话里是否主动浏览了该内容或同类内容）。</p>\n<p><strong>第二，设置长期留出组（holdout）。</strong> 从实验开始就固定 5%–10% 流量完全不受任何探索策略影响，持续数月，用来做最终的因果判定。留出组一旦设定就不能中途调整，否则时间序列被污染。这个设计与普通 A/B 的差别在于<strong>周期与分流稳定性</strong>，是 <a href=\"../diversity-ops/diversity-ab-experiment\">多样性 A/B 与效果验证</a> 里长周期实验的特殊形态。</p>\n<p><strong>第三，用反事实估计做离线验证。</strong> 用历史日志训练一个曝光模型，离线模拟「如果当时插入了探索位会怎样」。这类估计的可靠性取决于日志的探索充分性——而这恰恰是被茧房破坏的东西，所以离线估计只能作为方向参考，不能作为上线依据。这个循环依赖关系本身是茧房问题的一个有趣注脚：<strong>被茧房污染的数据无法用来评估抗茧房策略</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>茧房是<strong>反馈闭环 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>→</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>→</mo><mi>p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_t \\to y_t \\to \\hat\\theta\\_{t+1} \\to p\\_{t+1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2679em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9544em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span> 的稳态</strong>，源于曝光偏差造成的估计盲区，不是模型 bug。</li>\n<li>打破闭环的三类力量：<strong>注入</strong>（探索位）、<strong>正则</strong>（列表级多样性重排）、<strong>随机化</strong>；本文讲注入与度量。</li>\n<li>茧房度量有四个代理指标（类目熵趋势、曝光集中度、新类目发现率、跨用户多样性），判据必须是<strong>同群组时间序列</strong>而非横截面比较。</li>\n<li>探索位三类内容（低覆盖类目高分、高不确定度、新供给）对应三种探索目标；验收指标应是 SignalYield 而非 CTR。</li>\n<li>探索率三档：固定比例（可解释、建基线）→ ε-greedy（按新颖度调节）→ 上下文老虎机（长期最优、可解释性差）。</li>\n<li>执行顺序为<strong>去重 → 打散 → 插入探索位 → 重校验</strong>；探索候选选择必须基于去重键排除已展示项，并避开广告位与合规位。</li>\n<li>长期验证靠代理指标 + 长期留出组 + 反事实离线估计；注意被茧房污染的数据无法评估抗茧房策略。</li>\n<li>探索位的算法内核（Thompson 采样、UCB）见 <a href=\"diversity-exploit-explore\">利用与探索平衡</a>；按查询调多样强度见 <a href=\"query-dependent-diversity\">按查询意图调多样强度</a>；探索位与个性化的隐私边界见相邻 hub <code>../../94_personalization-privacy-balance/</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"信息茧房缓解与探索位","id":"信息茧房缓解与探索位"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：茧房是反馈闭环的稳态，不是模型错误","id":"核心概念-茧房是反馈闭环的稳态-不是模型错误"},{"level":2,"text":"茧房的度量：从行为日志里看收窄","id":"茧房的度量-从行为日志里看收窄"},{"level":2,"text":"探索位的三种插入方式","id":"探索位的三种插入方式"},{"level":2,"text":"探索率的调节：固定比例、ε-greedy 与自适应","id":"探索率的调节-固定比例-greedy-与自适应"},{"level":2,"text":"探索位与打散、去重的执行顺序","id":"探索位与打散-去重的执行顺序"},{"level":2,"text":"长期指标的验证难题","id":"长期指标的验证难题"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"跨分页去重一致性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-result-diversity-dedup/dedup-scatter/pagination-dedup-consistency"},"next":{"title":"按查询意图调多样强度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-result-diversity-dedup/personalization-balance/query-dependent-diversity"}}